n      Introduction 适度压缩；Method+Composition 精简表述；Experiments 保持完整但精简 DocRED 文字。\n      移出内容进入 Appendix。\n\n# ============================================================================\n# 压缩后论文结构（8 页正文）\n# ============================================================================\npaper_outline:\n  - section: abstract\n    file: abstract.tex\n    word_budget: 200  # from 225, -11%\n    action: trim\n    instructions: >\n      删减重复措辞。确保 4 要素齐全：problem, method, results, limitation flag。\n      数字保留：DR 15.4%→0.93%（↓94%），F1-neutral。CF 9.9% 作为 limitation 一句话提及。\n\n  - section: \"§1 Introduction\"\n    file: section1_introduction_draft.tex\n    word_budget: 550  # from 669, -18%\n    action: trim\n    instructions: >\n      保留所有核心内容但精简表述：\n      (1) Hook: violation 数据不变\n      (2) Gap: 合并 prompt/grammar/posthoc/training 4 段为 2 段更紧凑的对比\n      (3) Method: 保持 OntoCoDec 描述但删减细节（Worker 不展开 entity registry 工作原理）\n      (4) Contributions: 从 4 条压缩为 3 条（合并 C2+C3 为一条：framework + decidability taxonomy）\n      不含 fig1_overview（图移入 Method §3）\n\n  - section: \"§2 Background\"\n    file: section2_background.tex\n    word_budget: 250  # from 564, -56%\n    action: heavy_trim\n    instructions: >\n      大幅压缩，只保留后续正文需要的 notation 定义和 problem statement：\n      (1) §2.1 IE Ontology Structure: 保留 O=(E,R,σ) 定义 + type-valid 定义 + \n          constraint tightness 定义（1 句 + 1 个公式）。删除 SciERC/DocRED 具体数字\n          （这些在 Experiments 中自然出现）\n      (2) §2.2 Grammar-Constrained Decoding: 压缩为 2-3 句（cite XGrammar+Outlines，\n          点明 CFG 限制——不能做 cross-field semantic constraints）\n      (3) §2.3 Problem Statement: 保留 2 条 desiderata（structural + type validity），\n          保留 prefix-decidability 关键 insight（1 句）\n\n  - section: \"§3 Method\"\n    file: section3_method_draft.tex\n    word_budget: 1100  # from 1578, -30%\n    action: trim\n    instructions: >\n      核心贡献，保留技术细节但精简表述：\n      (1) §3.1 Problem Formulation: 保留 eq:output-schema + eq:type-valid + violation 定义，\n          但删减解释性文字（公式自解释）\n      (2) §3.2 Grammar Layer: 保留 JSON Schema→XGrammar→M_g 的编译流程，\n          删减 XGrammar 实现细节（读者可 cite 原文）\n      (3) §3.3 Semantic Layer: 完整保留 entity registry + position detection + dynamic masking，\n          这是核心新贡献\n      (4) §3.4 Layer Interaction: 保留 enabling dependency + grammar-first invariant，\n          但精简为 1 段（不需要完整的 conjunction 公式——Composition section 有）\n      (5) §3.5 Decoding Strategies: 保留 S1 描述（3-4 句），S2 压缩为 1 句 +\n          \"details in Appendix A\"\n      图 fig1_overview 放在 Method 开头\n\n  - section: \"§4 Constraint Composition\"\n    file: section4_composition_draft.tex\n    word_budget: 500  # from 787, -36%\n    action: trim\n    instructions: >\n      保留所有公式但精简文字：\n      (1) M_final = M_grammar ∧ M_semantic: 保留 eq:composition + 2 句解释\n      (2) Grammar-First Fallback: 压缩为 1 段（保留核心 rule + 1 句 rationale，\n          删除 logit threshold 细节）\n      (3) Constraint Tightness: 保留 eq:tightness + 1 句 intuition + SciERC/DocRED \n          数字对比。删除 Used-for example（读者不需要这个 level 的细节）\n      (4) Decidability Taxonomy: 保留 3-class 列表但每类压缩为 1 句。\n          删除最后段（OntoCoDec 覆盖前两类——读者已知）\n\n  - section: \"§5 Experiments\"\n    subsections:\n      - subsection: \"§5.1 Setup and Violation Landscape\"\n        file: section3_violation_landscape.tex\n        word_budget: 450  # from 838, -46%\n        action: restructure_and_trim\n        instructions: >\n          原 §3 Violation Landscape 整合为 §5.1，结构重构：\n          (1) 删除独立 section header，改为 \\subsection{Experimental Setup and Violation Landscape}\n          (2) Setup: 2-3 句（models, datasets, metrics 定义）\n          (3) 保留 tab:prompt_comparison（已创建），但删除表格周围的冗余文字描述\n          (4) Violation Distribution: 压缩为 1 段 key findings（DR 15.4% vs 18.7%，\n              tightness drives violations）。Per-relation analysis 压缩为 2 句\n              （Compare 42.4% vs Used-for 0.8% + correlation with tightness）\n          (5) Prompt Insufficiency: 压缩为 1 段（SciERC ↓62% but DocRED only ↓31%；\n              Evaluate-for 反而 +5.8pp → prompt 不可靠）\n       