ion: rewrite\n    instructions: >\n      完全重写为 positioning statements，每类工作 2-3 句 + citations：\n      (1) Grammar-constrained decoding: XGrammar/Outlines/LMQL 保证 syntactic validity \n          但不做 semantic constraints [3 citations, 2 句]\n      (2) Semantic constrained decoding (code): Synchromesh/PICARD/MGD/PLDI'25 \n          在代码域做 type checking [4 citations, 2 句]\n      (3) Vocabulary/type-constrained IE: GCD/AdaKGC/GoLLIE/GENRE 做 vocabulary\n          约束但不做 cross-field semantic [4 citations, 2 句]\n      (4) Post-hoc validation: ODKE+/OntoGPT/OntoLogX 检测-修复但不 prevent \n          [3 citations, 2 句]\n      (5) Constrained decoding quality: CRANE/Hidden Cost 担忧质量下降，\n          但 IE 是 extraction 非 reasoning [2 citations, 1 句]\n      (6) OntoCoDec positioning: 1 句总结差异化\n      完整版 Related Work 移入 Appendix B\n\n  - section: \"§7 Conclusion\"\n    file: section7_conclusion_compressed.tex  # new merged file\n    word_budget: 500  # from 668+819=1487, -66%\n    action: merge_and_rewrite\n    instructions: >\n      合并 discussion_paragraphs.tex 关键内容 + section7_conclusion.tex：\n      (1) Contributions summary: 3 句话（violation landscape + framework + empirical 94%）\n      (2) CF severity 精简版（from discussion ¶2）: 3 句——CF 是 per-relation independent \n          enforcement 的系统性副作用，grammar-only CF=0.08% 证实 100% 由 semantic 层引入，\n          dominant pattern Generic↔OtherScientificTerm 反映 type system 歧义\n      (3) F1 significance explanation 精简版（from discussion ¶3）: 2 句——DocRED F1 gain \n          来自 grammar 消除 OOV relations（29.66% RV → 0%），SciERC RV 仅 1.39% 故 F1 \n          effect 不显著\n      (4) Limitations: 3-4 句（CF 9.9% open challenge，2 models，zero-shot only，\n          parse failures on DocRED-Llama）\n      (5) Future work: 2 句（global entity consensus + fine-tuned integration）\n      Low F1 practical significance 和 Post-hoc comparison 移入 Appendix C\n\n  - section: \"Appendix\"\n    files:\n      - appendix_related_work.tex  # full version of §6\n      - appendix_discussion.tex    # m